        "id": 2838963,
        "name": "Azuleas KURT",
        "username": "Azuleas_KURT",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/azuleas_kurt/{size}/476134_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-15T02:08:05.854Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone. I’m someone who enjoys PvE, likes big ships, and loves playing games with a pet (drone) system. Therefore, a Carrier would be perfect for me. My goal was to complete L5 missions with my Carrier and continue with my life. However, I recently learned that Carriers can’t participate in most L5 missions… This has put me in a difficult position. I have no idea what to do now. I would be very grateful if anyone could help me with what I should do.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>I want to play this game with a carrier (I have Kronos and I can easily earn 500M daily). I say this to emphasize that money isn’t an issue.</li>\n<li>I’m a solo player; I don’t have the qualifications to join a group or community, nor do I want to.</li>\n<li>I don’t want to do PvP. The PvP logic of this game goes against my values, so I will never be the first to attack.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Risks aren’t important to me; I just want to do PvE with a carrier. I would appreciate any information you can give me about what I can do.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 7,
        "updated_at": "2026-02-15T02:08:05.854Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
