        "created_at": "2026-02-15T05:57:45.640Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since when can carriers not run L5 missions? They were the Go-To-Ship for L5s in the past.</p>\n<p>However, even if you can run them with carriers, they are all in low sec and the systems they are in are usually watched and camped to get these carriers killed.</p>",
