        "created_at": "2026-02-15T12:19:46.274Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Carriers can be used in L5 missions, yes, and they are quite dangerous. However, most L5 missions involve Acceleration Gates. This prevents me from using carriers in 80% of the missions.</p>",
