        "created_at": "2026-02-15T13:13:25.056Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is ChatGPT’s answer to your question.</p>\n<p>Assigning fighters to an alt does not bypass acceleration gate restrictions. Fighters cannot enter a different mission pocket because they cannot use acceleration gates, warp independently, or cross grid boundaries. If the carrier cannot enter the pocket, the fighters cannot either.</p>",
