        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/syzygium/{size}/431744_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-16T03:24:56.716Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you want to do Carrier PvE, you could do that in Nullsec or Wormholes. The Anomalies there don’t have Gates.</p>\n<p>In Lowsec you’d get tackled and hotdropped pretty fast anyway, I highly doubt any Carrier used for L5s there will even pay for itself. Well, unless you are part of one of the big bluetrain groups that hotdrop everyone else… but you said you like solo play and don’t want to be part of a group. So yeah, no realistic chance for you to do L5s in a carrier.</p>",
